    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0841" n="745" xml:id="pg745"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51 Salt Funds/193</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Embassy in Japan to the Japanese Ministry
                        for Foreign Affairs</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Aide-mémoire</hi></p>
                <p>Reference is made to the American Embassy’s <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >aide-mémoire</hi> of March 19, 1938, relating to certain phases of the
                    functioning of the Chinese Salt Administration in the areas occupied by Japanese
                    forces in China, pointing out the substantial American interest in the Chinese
                    Salt Administration and making full reservation in regard to American rights and
                    interests therein.</p>
                <p>In this relation the American Government would welcome assurances from the
                    Japanese Government that it is prepared to accord full respect to American
                    interests in the China salt revenues.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1938-06-21">June 21,
                            1938</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
